
Copy the authorized_keys from ec2-user to created user (viswa)
==============================================================

sudo mkdir -p /home/viswa/.ssh
sudo cp /home/ec2-user/.ssh/authorized_keys /home/viswa/.ssh/
sudo chown -R viswa:viswa /home/viswa/.ssh
sudo chmod 700 /home/viswa/.ssh
sudo chmod 600 /home/viswa/.ssh/authorized_keys



To connect:
===========
ssh -i my-key.pem viswa@54.210.100.25


whoami   --> to verify the user




To disconnect:
==============
exit  or  ctrl+D   
